    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d593">

                <pb facs="0501" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/843.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Livingston to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Cape Haitien</hi></placeName>, [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">received</hi>
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" type="received-date" when="1914-02-16"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 16, 1914</hi></date><hi
                            rendition="#italic">; undated.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Just received cablegram from President of Haiti requesting protection of family
                    here of Minister of Interior Charles Zamor. Have conferred with Commanders of
                        <hi rendition="#italic">San Francisco</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wheeling</hi> and we advise acceptance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Livingston</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
